  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_22e74389",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《拉海洛历史地理学导论》其一",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_94feb316",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_409bb7e4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在过去，拉海洛是一片具于寒带中的峡湾，无数森林与湖泊分布其中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c0830228",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在此之中，有两个尤为重要的地区：其一是一片林地，它是彼时是罗伊族祖先取得生存资源的重要场所，被称作“元林”，意为“树木生长的地方”；其二则是一处湖泽，它是古时拉海洛的第一大湖，也是族内最重要的淡水来源，被称作为“渐湖”，意为“无边的水泽”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_781e1c1d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在磁极变化后，拉海洛成为新的极点，被厚重的冰雪覆盖，元林中的树木被封入冻土与冰层之中，渐湖亦因极低的气温差点化作了厚重冰盖的一部分。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_52207253",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但万幸的是，在渐湖一旁的高崖上，因为地质运动生成了一处盐晶温泉，其日夜不竭地将暖流汇入渐湖中，使得渐湖成为了难得一见的不冻湖。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1d8b54b2",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《拉海洛历史地理学导论》其二",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_eab3e3d5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ddc00d32",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "随着先行公约的踏足，与世隔绝的拉海洛得以初次与文明世界相遇。而此时罗伊族人内部出现了两种截然不同的态度。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c6158f23",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "大部分罗伊族人对外界的事物不为所动，他们坚持着自身的使命与文化传统，坚持着族中一直以来的生活方式。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0253bc47",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但也有少部分人，他们对于外部世界的好奇心压过了对于族中的规训——他们试图出卖隧者与隧群的残骸，以此作为进入文明世界的“入场券”。这些人被认定为忘却与唾弃了使命的罗伊族，他们被族人驱逐，被称作为“流民”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_25e63cd4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在进入拉海洛的调查团野蛮生长的时期，这些“流民”曾自诩为族人中的“开化者”，认为自己才是与文明世界接轨的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c78fcc4a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但是，随着「极地联合」建立，以及罗伊族人自身也坐上谈判桌成为了影响拉海洛局势的一环，这些“流民”最终成为了不被任何一方所承认的游荡势力。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b1669aad",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5f9513ba",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "随着罗伊冰原的探索工作推进，元林遗址的挖掘行动获得了突出进展，元林再生舱得以建立——它为人们描摹出了远古时期广袤的元林的图景。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_efa4ff6d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这一发现为背弃族群的流民们提供了新的方向——他们来到元林遗址附近，期望找到远古时期的家园，为没有根基的流民群体找到新的归宿。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}